'' A HEADER EDIT MISSES EXACTLY ITS INCLUDERS (PLAN B3): hdr.bi is in b.tiko's deps.txt and not
'' in a.tiko's, so b misses on "a file it read changed" and a hits; b prints the new value.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.uce/cache
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.uce
'' COPY: tests/driver/src/unitcache => build/.uce/src
'' STEP: build -target windows-x86_64 build/.uce/src/a.tiko build/.uce/src/b.tiko -o build/.uce/app.exe
'' WRITE: build/.uce/src/hdr.bi :: '' edited\n#define HDR_VALUE 9\n
'' ARGS: build -target windows-x86_64 build/.uce/src/a.tiko build/.uce/src/b.tiko -o build/.uce/app.exe -v
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: unit build/.uce/src/a.tiko: hit
'' EXPECT-OUT: unit build/.uce/src/b.tiko: miss (a file it read changed)
'' RUN: build/.uce/app.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: b says 9
